# Schedule definitions for thorn MCNuX

# Paramcheck guard of specs/carpetx-thorn-integration.md [MCNX-CTX-06]. The
# routine is scheduled unconditionally and branches on the parameter inside
# its body, so that the abort is reached in exactly the configuration the
# spec forbids. Global mode: the routine touches no grid data (hence no
# READS:/WRITES: clauses) and must run exactly once.

SCHEDULE MCNuX_ParamCheck AT CCTK_PARAMCHECK
{
  LANG: C
  OPTIONS: global
} "Abort when CarpetX subcycling is enabled (MCNuX transport is single-rate)"
